 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Certes... mais",
     "texto": [
      "**Certes** (certainly) recognizes a point, and **mais** (but) introduces the objection: **Certes, il est riche, mais il est triste** (granted, he is rich, but he is sad)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Il est vrai que, je reconnais que",
     "texto": [
      "**Il est vrai que** + clause (it is true that) and **je reconnais que** (I acknowledge that) also take the indicative: **Il est vrai que Paul travaille beaucoup** (it is true that Paul works a lot)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Concéder",
     "texto": [
      "**Je te concède ce point** (I grant you that point) introduces a personal concession."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
